        "original_id": "78f4a959-025b-52c9-bbad-c1916e77bad7",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Riaz ur Rehman Saghar, Hadiqa Kiani, Asha Bhosle, Adnan Sami Khan\n- Topics: Songs, awards, performance venues\n\nFacts:\n- Riaz ur Rehman Saghar is credited with writing over 25,000 songs during his lifetime.\n- Riaz ur Rehman Saghar wrote songs for Pakistani singer Hadiqa Kiani, including \"Dupatta Mera Malmal Da\" and \"Yaad Sajan Di Ayi.\"\n- Riaz ur Rehman Saghar wrote \"Kabhi to Nazar Milao,\" a duet song performed by Asha Bhosle and Adnan Sami Khan.\n- Hadiqa Kiani has received numerous local and international awards.\n- Hadiqa Kiani has performed at major international venues including Royal Albert Hall and the Kennedy Center.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "55b07d56-1081-51e3-ba08-4a4a4d28577a",
        "text": "Page: Riaz ur Rehman Saghar. Sentence: He is credited with having written over 25000 songs in his lifetime, including many for noted Pakistani singers such as Hadiqa Kiani (\"Dupatta Mera Malmal Da\" [دوپٹہ میرا ململ دا], \"Yaad Sajan Di Ayi\" [یاد سجن دی آوے]) and a duet song with Asha Bhosle and Adnan Sami Khan (\"Kabhi to Nazar Milao\" [کبھی تو نظر ملاؤ]).\nPage: Hadiqa Kiani. Sentence: She has received numerous local and international awards and also has performed at the most prestigious venues in the world, including Royal Albert Hall and The Kennedy Center.",
